<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:x="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"><head><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><x:ExcelWorkbook><x:ExcelWorksheets><x:ExcelWorksheet><x:Name>Worksheet</x:Name><x:WorksheetOptions><x:DisplayGridlines/></x:WorksheetOptions></x:ExcelWorksheet></x:ExcelWorksheets></x:ExcelWorkbook></xml><![endif]--></head><body><table>
    
    

   
   <thead>      
      <tr>
         <th aria-label="Name" data-stat="player" scope="col" class=" poptip sort_default_asc show_partial_when_sorting left" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Player Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold&lt;/strong&gt; can mean player is active for this team&lt;br&gt;or player has appeared in the majors&lt;br&gt;* means LHP or LHB,&lt;br&gt;# means switch hitter,&lt;br&gt;+ can mean HOFer.">Name</th>
         <th aria-label="Age" data-stat="age" scope="col" class=" poptip sort_default_asc show_partial_when_sorting center" data-tip="Player’s age at midnight of June 30th of that year">Age</th>
         <th aria-label="Yrs" data-stat="experience" scope="col" class=" poptip show_partial_when_sorting center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Years the player was/has been in the major leagues.&lt;br&gt;1st indicates their first year in the majors, &lt;br&gt;but does not indicate rookie status.&lt;br&gt;Includes parts of any seasons.">Yrs</th>
         <th aria-label="Acquired" data-stat="how_acquired" scope="col" class=" poptip sort_default_asc left" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;How Player was Acquired&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The last transaction between the player and the team.&lt;br&gt;For instance, players drafted by a team, but then resigned as free agents&lt;br&gt;would be listed as a free agent.">Acquired</th>
         <th aria-label="SrvTm" data-stat="service_time" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="Player&amp;#x2019;s service time in YY.DDD format typically through the end of the last completed season.&lt;br&gt;Service time determines when a player reaches arbitration or free agency.">SrvTm</th>
         <th aria-label="Agent" data-stat="agent" scope="col" class=" poptip sort_default_asc left" data-tip="The player&amp;#x2019;s current agent. Agents tend to be somewhat secretive about this&lt;br&gt;due to fear of poaching so it can be difficult to maintain.">Agent</th>
         <th aria-label="Contract Status" data-stat="contract_summary" scope="col" class=" poptip left" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Summary of player&amp;#x2019;s contract status&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Length&lt;/strong&gt; of the contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Value&lt;/strong&gt; including buyouts and signing bonuses&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seasons&lt;/strong&gt; contract is guaranteed&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Options&lt;/strong&gt; including player, team, mutual and vesting options&lt;br&gt;Summaries are as of right now, so as options are exercised or&lt;br&gt;declined the contract may change.">Contract Status</th>
         <th aria-label="2026" data-stat="contract_y0" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Player Status Prior to Season for Future Seasons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars&lt;/strong&gt; alone indicate a guaranteed contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars and [*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicates value is a buyout, mouseover [*] for option value,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[FA-*] or [Arb-*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicate status if option is declined.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of pre-arbitration eligibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of arbitration eligibility. Players with Arb-4 are Super Twos or expected to be.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FA&lt;/strong&gt; indicates the player will enter free agency prior to the season.">2026</th>
         <th aria-label="2027" data-stat="contract_y1" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Player Status Prior to Season for Future Seasons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars&lt;/strong&gt; alone indicate a guaranteed contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars and [*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicates value is a buyout, mouseover [*] for option value,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[FA-*] or [Arb-*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicate status if option is declined.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of pre-arbitration eligibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of arbitration eligibility. Players with Arb-4 are Super Twos or expected to be.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FA&lt;/strong&gt; indicates the player will enter free agency prior to the season.">2027</th>
